{"data":{"content":"\"\"\"Lab 0: Getting Started.\"\"\"\n\n\ndef twenty_twenty_six():\n    \"\"\"Come up with the most creative expression that evaluates to 2026\n    using only numbers and the +, *, and - operators (or ** and % if you'd like).\n\n    >>> twenty_twenty_six()\n    2026\n    \"\"\"\n    return 2 * 1000 + 26 + 1 - 1\n","line_count":12,"path":"lab00.py","sha256":"d090c200b5e48723f962d03ba16fb4173e732125f88cb4e5116713be6dea5958"},"hash":"b831341a13e0ae60ec336c8245b142683bea48064c717fd12f80cba8cbff0578","kind":"doc.open","prev_hash":"43fa7530cab4f296cbe301296f51f0ac9816288475253431b7156b6b0ccd5016","seq":1,"t":4,"wall":"2026-08-27T22:24:02.647Z"}
